hmi Icon landmark tower view](static/images/rashmi-icon-mlalad-elevation.jpg)\n\n![Rashmi Icon Grand Entrance Lobby](static/images/rashmi-icon-mlalad-elevation.jpg)\n\n## Rashmi Icon\n\nby Modis Navnirman\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\nPremium 1, 2 & 3 BHK   \n PRICING  **On Request**\n\n![Rashmi Icon landmark tower at Malad West](static/images/rashmi-icon-mlalad-elevation.jpg)\n\n![Rashmi Icon Grand Entrance Lobby](static/images/rashmi-icon-mlalad-elevation.jpg)\n\nModis Navnirman Presents\n\n# Rashmi Icon\n\n## Malad West, Mumbai\n\nOn Request\n\n1, 2 & 3 BHK\n\n![Rashmi Icon elevation](static/images/rashmi-icon-mlalad-elevation.jpg)\n\n![Modis Navnirman logo](static/images/rh2.jpg)\n\nOverview\n\n## Iconic Way of Living at Malad West\n\n### Welcome to Rashmi Icon\n\nStanding tall at 18 stories, Rashmi Icon is a landmark of modern luxury, combining elegant architecture, premium finishes, and thoughtfully designed residences. Welcoming residents with a grand double-height lobby, every detail reflects sophistication and comfort. Beyond the homes, curated lifestyle amenities—including tranquil Zen gardens, an outdoor cinema, children's pool, and play areas—create spaces for relaxation, recreation, and connection. More than a residence, Rashmi Icon offers an iconic way of living, where comfort, balance, and elevated experiences come together seamlessly.\n\n### About Modis Navnirman Limited\n\nBuilding dreams and creating legacies in Mumbai's premium real estate landscape, Modis Navnirman Limited is a trusted name known for quality construction, innovative design, and customer-centric planning. With a strong focus on delivering value-driven developments, Modis Navnirman has established a reputation for excellence in residential and commercial projects across Mumbai.\n\n### Seamlessly Connected\n\nRashmi Icon offers excellent connectivity with SV Road, Malad Metro Station, schools, colleges, hospitals, and major shopping destinations like Inorbit Mall and Infinity Mall within easy reach.\n\n### Project Highlights\n\n• 18-Story Landmark Tower • Grand Double-Height Lobby • Mixed-Use Development (Residential & Commercial) • 3 Residential Wings • 201 Well-Designed Flats • Premium Lifestyle Amenities • Excellent Connectivity\n\n### Configurations & Area\n\n• 1 BHK: 426+ sq.ft (Carpet Area) • 2 BHK: 469-678+ sq.ft (Carpet Area) • 3 BHK: 678+ sq.ft (Carpet Area)\n\n### Possession\n\nAugust 2028\n\nPossession\n\nAug'28\n\nTower Height\n\n18 Stories\n\nConfigurations\n\n1, 2 & 3 BHK\n\nCarpet Area\n\n426 - 678+ sq.ft\n\nMetro Station\n\n5 Mins\n\nRERA No.\n\nTo be updated\n\nProject Highlights\n\n## Rashmi Icon Highlights\n\n* Iconic 18-Story Landmark Tower\n* Grand Double-Height Lobby\n* Mixed-Use Development with Commercial Spaces\n* 3 Residential Wings with 201 Flats\n* Premium Lifestyle Amenities\n* Terrace Garden | Indoor Games | Kids Play Area | Multipurpose Turf | Jogging Track | Outdoor Lawn | Gymnasium | Yoga Centre\n\n![Rashmi Icon amenities](static/images/167160_0030054bc3444a3d83c072556421b822~mv2.avif)\n\nConfigurations & Pricing\n\n## Price of Rashmi Icon\n\nPerfectly configured homes with thoughtful designs and premium finishes.\n\n* ![Rashmi Icon 1 BHK floor plan — 426+ sq.ft. carpet area apartment](floorplan.png)\n\n  Typology 1 BHK\n\n  Carpet Area 426+ Sq.Ft.\n\n  Price  On Request\n\n  Cost Sheet  Get Cost Sheet\n* ![Rashmi Icon 2 BHK floor plan — 469-678+ sq.ft. carpet area apartment](floorplan.png)\n\n  Typology 2 BHK\n\n  Carpet Area 469-678+ Sq.Ft.\n\n  Price  On Request\n\n  Cost Sheet  Get Cost Sheet\n* ![Rashmi Icon 3 BHK floor plan — 678+ sq.ft. carpet area apartment](floorplan.png)\n\n  Typology 3 BHK\n\n  Carpet Area 678+ Sq.Ft.\n\n  Price  On Request\n\n  Cost Sheet  Get Cost Sheet\n\nLuxury Lifestyle Amenities\n\n## Rashmi Icon Amenities\n\nLive a life of unmatched comfort at Rashmi Icon. Enjoy world-class amenities designed to elevate your everyday living.\n\n* Terrace Garden\n* Indoor Games\n* Kids Play Area\n* Multipurpose Turf\n* Jogging Track\n* Outdoor Lawn\n* Gymnasium\n* Yoga Centre\n\n![Gymnasium at Rashmi Icon](static/images/167160_0030054bc3444a3d83c072556421b822~mv2.avif)\n\nGymnasium\n\n![Kids Play Area at Rashmi Icon](static/images/kids-play-area.jpg)\n\nKids Play Area\n\n![Jogging Track at Rashmi Icon](static/images/jogging-track.jpg)\n\nJogging Track\n\nLocation & Connectivity\n\n## Rashmi Icon Connectivity\n\n![Rashmi Icon location map image](static/images/map.png)\n\n* Malad Metro Station 5 mins\n* SV Road 2 mins\n* Infiniti Mall 10 mins\n* Inorbit Mall 12 mins\n* Billabong High School 5 mins\n* Kokilaben Hospital 15 mins\n* Mindspace IT Park 10 mins\n\nStill Got Doubts\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\nWhat makes Rashmi Icon stand out in Malad West? +\n\nRashmi Icon stands out for its iconic 18-story tower, grand double-height lobby, mixed-use development with 3 residential wings and premium amenities including terrace garden, gymnasium, and multipurpose turf.\n\nWhat types of homes are available at Rashmi Icon? +\n\nRashmi Icon offers spacious 1 BHK (426+ sq.ft), 2 BHK (469-678+ sq.ft), and 3 BHK (678+ sq.ft) residences.\n\nWhat kind of lifestyle amenities can residents expect? +\n\nResidents can enjoy an array of amenities including Terrace Garden, Indoor Games, Kids Play Area, Multipurpose Turf, Jogging Track, Outdoor Lawn, Gymnasium, and Yoga Centre.\n\nHow well connected is Rashmi Icon? +\n\nRashmi Icon offers excellent connectivity with Malad Metro Station (5 mins), SV Road (2 mins), schools, hospitals, and major shopping destinations like Infiniti Mall and Inorbit Mall within easy reach.\n\nIs Rashmi Icon a good choice for long term living and investment? +\n\nWith its prime location, top-tier amenities, and the trusted brand of Modis Navnirman Limited, Rashmi Icon is an excellent choice for both long-term living and a sound investment.\n\n### About Modis Navnirman Limited\n\nBuilding dreams and creating legacies in Mumbai's premium real estate landscape, Modis Navnirman Limited is a trusted name known for quality construction, innovative design, and customer-centric planning. With a strong focus on delivering value-driven developments, Modis Navnirman has established a reputation for excellence in residential and commercial projects across Mumbai.\n\nTrusted Developer Quality Construction Customer-Centric Planning\n\nQuick Enquiry\n\n[WhatsApp](https://wa.me/919136081235?text=Hi, I'm interested in Rashmi Icon. Please share more details.)   [Call Now](tel:+919136081235)\n\n🚫 Content protected\n\n ","images":[]},{"url":"https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/modis-rashmi-signature","title":"Modis Rashmi Signature Malad West | 2 & 3 BHK at Mumbai by Modis Navnirman Group","raw_content":"# Modis Rashmi Signature Malad West, Mumbai\n\n## Modis Rashmi Signature Overview\n\n|  |  |  |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Project Name | Modis Rashmi Signature | Location | Malad West, Mumbai |\n| Developer | Modis Navnirman Group | Possessions | December 31, 2027 |\n| Project Sub Type | Apartment | Project Type | Residential |\n| Storey | G+18 Storey | Towers/Wings | 3 |\n| Land Parcel | N/A | Rera No. | P51800077248 |\n| Per/sqft Onwards | N/A | No. of Units | N/A |\n| Carpet Area | 600 – 960 Sqft | Typology | 2 & 3 BHK |\n| Total Area | N/A | Security | N/A |\n\nPrice: ₹1.86 Cr\\* - 2.97 Cr\\*\n\n## Modis Rashmi Signature Key Features\n\n* Smart layouts with spacious living, planned for light, ventilation & comfort\n* Gated community surrounded by greenery for a calmer everyday vibe\n* Construction Status- 70% Completed\n* Parking: Ramp + Surface\n* Vastu Compiant homes\n\n## Modis Rashmi Signature Gallery\n\n![Modis-Rashmi-Signature-Elevation](https://digipaces.com/storage/Modis-Rashmi-Signature-Elevation.jpg)\n\n![Modis-Rashmi-Signature-Elevation](https://digipaces.com/storage/Modis-Rashmi-Signature-Elevation.jpg)\n\n## Modis Rashmi Signature About\n\n**Modis Rashmi Signature Malad West Mumbai** is a Project by **Modis Navnirman Group** situated in the most premium location of Mumbai, Malad West, Sunder Nagar offers **2 & 3 BHK** Flats with the availability of Jodi Apartments. Also get Floor Plan, Price Sheet, RERA ID, Reviews, Possession Timeline, Construction Status, Location Advantages, Address, Amenities & Specifications.\n\nModis Navnirman Group Modis Rashmi Signature Mumbai has **3** Towers of **G+18** Storeys. Modis Rashmi Signature Mumbai Maha **RERA** P51800077248 with **Carpet** of 2 BHK 600 sqft to 3 BHK 900 sqft, with Starting **Price** 1.86 Cr.\n\nModis Navnirman Group Mumbai Property Features Handpicked **Amenities like** Indoor Games, Kids Play area, Gymnasium, Landscaped garden, Yoga Meditation, Jogging Track, Gazebo, Badminton Court, Multipurpose Court, Senior citizen area.\n\nModis Rashmi Signature Mumbai Has **Excellent Connectivity** SV Road-3 mins, Metro + Link Road-7 mins, Malad Station-10 mins, Rejoice International School-2 min, Father Angelo high school- 4 min, Sai Surabh nursing home-2 min, D mart-4 min, Infinity Mall-6 min.\n\nMalad West is well-connected to Andheri, Borivali, Bandra, Goregaon, Kandivali\n\nModis Navnirman Group has many ongoing, upcoming & completed Projects Rashmi Signature-Malad West, Rashmi Celestia- Borivali west, Rashmi Square- Borivali west, Rashmi Vasudeo-Borivali west, Rashmi Enclave-Mumbai.\n\n## Modis Rashmi Signature Floor Plans\n\n[![2 BHK](https://digipaces.com/storage/Modis-Rashmi-Signature-2BHK-600sqft-unit-plan.jpg)](https://digipaces.com/storage/Modis-Rashmi-Signature-2BHK-600sqft-unit-plan.jpg) \n\n**Name:** 2 BHK\n\n**Carpet Size:** 600 sqft sq. ft.\n\n**Total Area:** N/A sq. ft.\n\n**Furnishing Status:** Unfurnished\n\n**Price:** ₹18,600,000.00\n\n**Rental:** ₹N/A\n\n**Deposit:** ₹0.00\n\n**Description:** N/A\n\n[![3 BHK](https://digipaces.com/storage/Modis-Rashmi-Signature-3BHK-960sqft-unit-plan.jpg)](https://digipaces.com/storage/Modis-Rashmi-Signature-3BHK-960sqft-unit-plan.jpg) \n\n**Name:** 3 BHK\n\n**Carpet Size:** 960 sqft sq. ft.\n\n**Total Area:** N/A sq. ft.\n\n**Furnishing Status:** Unfurnished\n\n**Price:** ₹29,700,000.00\n\n**Rental:** ₹N/A\n\n**Deposit:** ₹0.00\n\n**Description:** N/A\n\n## Modis Rashmi Signature Price\n\n| Name | Carpet Area | Price | Furnishing Status |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK | 600 sqft sq. ft. | ₹1.86 Cr\\* | Unfurnished |\n| 3 BHK | 960 sqft sq. ft. | ₹2.97 Cr\\* | Unfurnished |\n\n## Modis Rashmi Signature Amenities\n\nIndoor Games Room\n\njogging track\n\nLandscaped Garden\n\nmeditation area\n\nGymnasium\n\nKid's Play Area\n\nGazebo\n\nBadminton & Multipurpose Court\n\nSenior citizen area\n\n## Modis Rashmi Signature Features\n\nVitrified Tiles for Living, Dining, Kitchen & Bedrooms\n\nKitchen platform with SS sink & Drain board\n\nWash Basin Counters\n\nAnti-skid tiles in the Balcony\n\nVitrified Tile Dado 2'0\" high above Kitchen platform\n\n## Modis Rashmi Signature Walkthrough Video\n\n## Modis Rashmi Signature Location\n\n  \n\n**Modis Rashmi Signature Address (Sales Gallery/Office/Experience Center):**   \nRashmi Signature, New Link Rd, Malad, Sunder Nagar, Malad West, Mumbai, 400064\n\n## Modis Rashmi Signature Location Advantages\n\nMetro + Link Road\n\n1 km\n\nMalad Station\n\n1.2Km\n\nRejoice International School\n\n0.15km\n\nSai Surabh nursing home\n\n0.13km\n\nInfinity Mall\n\n0.65km\n\n## Developer\n\n![01KKX4512FYFRYAPW27W8CZETR](https://digipaces.com/storage/developer-logos/01KKX4512FYFRYAPW27W8CZETR.jpg)\n\nModis Navnirman Group\n\nModis Navnirman Group is a fast-growing real estate company in Mumbai that maintains high standards and aspires to gain a strong foothold in the real estate industry. It believes in absolute customer satisfaction and aims to set benchmarks by providing spectacular projects. To meet and exceed customer’s expectations, the company operates with complete transparency. It ensures that its projects are equipped with superior amenities and provide the best value for money as well as a sense of satisfaction to the customers.\n\n## Modis Rashmi Signature FAQ's\n\nModis Rashmi Signature offers 2 BHK 600 sqft to 3 BHK 900 sqft homes\n\nLocated near SV Road-3 mins, Metro + Link Road-7 mins, Malad Station-10 mins, Rejoice International School-2 min, Father Angelo high school- 4 min, Sai Surabh nursing home-2 min, D mart-4 min, Infinity Mall-6 min, the property offers excellent connectivity\n\nYes, Modis Rashmi Signature is an RERA-authorized project with MahaRERA number P51800077248\n\n## Modis Rashmi Signature Maharashtra RERA Details\n\nNo documents available.\n\n## Get In Touch\n\n## Latest Projects in Malad West\n\n[PCPL Falcon Crest](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/pcpl-falcon-crest)   [Modirealty Olive](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/modirealty-olive)   [Chaitanya Ethics Orovia](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/chaitanya-ethics-orovia)   [Malad Vrindavan CHSL](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/malad-vrindavan-chsl)   [Aquarock Aquarose](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/aquarock-aquarose)   [H Rishabraj Ceramont](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/h-rishabraj-ceramont)   [Ruparel Stardom](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/ruparel-stardom)   [Anchor Point Aviara](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/anchor-point-aviara)   [Priyam Residency](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/priyam-residency)   [Stans Marve Royal](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/stans-marve-royal)   [Ajmera Boulevard](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/ajmera-boulevard)   [Raj Imperia](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/raj-imperia)   [Royal Bliss](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/royal-bliss)   [Narang Vivenda](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/narang-vivenda)   [Shreeji Tapovan](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/shreeji-tapovan)   [Arkade Eden](https://digipaces.com/projects/mumbai/malad-west/arkade-eden)\n\n## Share this Project:\n\n ","images":[]},{"url":"https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/modi-rashmi-heights/123920/project","title":"Modi Rashmi Heights, Kandivali West, Mumbai - Price Starts from ₹1.64 Cr Onwards | 2, 3 BHK Flats Available","raw_content":"![Squareyards Logo](/assets/images/squareyards.png?aio=w-82;h-32;crop;)\n![Modi Nirman Builder And Developer developer logo](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/developerlogo/modi-nirman-builder-and-developer-13446.jpg?aio=w-128;h-128;crop;)\n\n# Modi Rashmi Heights Kandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Modi Rashmi Heights Cover Image](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/modi-rashmi-heights-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-725;h-350;crop;)\n![Modi Rashmi Heights Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/modi-rashmi-heights-project-tower-view1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Modi Rashmi Heights Floor Plans](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/modi-rashmi-heights-project-floor-plans1-4145.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n![Modi Rashmi Heights Video](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-modi-rashmi-heights-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-192;h-168;crop;)\n\n**₹1.64 Cr - 2.97 Cr**\n\n₹32,000 Per Sq. Ft.\n\n## Why Invest Through Square Yards?\n\n![Zero brokerage icon](/assets/images/zero-brokerage.svg)\n\n### Zero Brokerage\n\n100% Service, 0% Brokerage\n\n![Lowest price icon](/assets/images/lowest-price.svg)\n\n### Lowest Price Guaranteed\n\nHighly unlikely, but if you find a lower price anywhere, tell us and we will match it.\n\n![Full service support icon](/assets/images/full-service-support.svg)\n\n### Full Service Support\n\nOur sales personnel are accountable for every step.\n\n## About Modi Rashmi Heights, Kandivali West by Modi Nirman Builder And Developer\n\n## Modi Rashmi Heights Price List, Price Trends and Market Insights\n\n### Price List\n\nView the latest price list for Modi Rashmi Heights.\n\n| Unit Type (Carpet) | Price\\* | Action |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  514 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 1.64 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 2 BHK Apartment  700 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.24 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  737 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.36 Cr** | Check Availability |\n| 3 BHK Apartment  930 Sq. Ft. | **₹ 2.97 Cr** | Check Availability |\n\n\\*Prices are indicative and subject to applicable charges and project terms.\n\n### Price Trends\n\nModi Rashmi Heights's average asking price is rising quarter-on-quarter, compared with Kandivali West.\n\nSep 2025 — Jun 2026\n\n| Quarter | Modi Rashmi Heights | Kandivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Jun 2026 | 32000 | 27000 |\n| Mar 2026 | 22450 | 25100 |\n| Dec 2025 | 21600 | 25750 |\n| Sep 2025 | 21550 | 27100 |\n\n### Comparable Projects\n\nModi Rashmi Heights avg. price is ₹ 32 K/Sq.Ft. compared to Kandivali West at ₹ 27 K/Sq.Ft.\n\n| Project | Avg. ₹/sq ft |\n| --- | --- |\n| [Shapoorji Pallonji Epsilon](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shapoorji-pallonji-epsilon/7398/project \"Shapoorji Pallonji Epsilon\") | ₹ 34,750 |\n| [Lodha Woods](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/lodha-woods/112847/project \"Lodha Woods\") | ₹ 33,050 |\n| Current Project **Modi Rashmi Heights** | ₹ 32,000 |\n| [Shapoorji Pallonji Astron](https://www.squareyards.com/mumbai-residential-property/shapoorji-pallonji-astron/8730/project \"Shapoorji Pallonji Astron\") | ₹ 31,400 |\n| Kandivali West | ₹ 27,000 |\n\n### Rentals\n\nMonthly Rent in Modi Rashmi Heights start from ₹ 55 K with options available for 2 BHK units\n\n| Configuration | In Modi Rashmi Heights | In Kandivali West |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| 1 BHK | - | ₹ 35 K |\n| 2 BHK | ₹ 55 K | ₹ 49.5 K |\n| 3 BHK | - | ₹ 75.6 K |\n\n### Recent Updates\n\nGet the latest price and market updates for Modi Rashmi Heights.\n\n#### Mumbai's Water Stock at 95.97% with Seven Lakes Holding High Levels\n\nMumbai's water stock has reached 95.97%, with seven lakes maintaining high levels. This ensures a stable water supply for the city, though civic authorities continue to monitor reservoir levels and rainfall.\n\nRent in Modi Rashmi Heights ranges from ₹ 50 K to ₹ 61 K with options available for 2 BHK.\n\nDuring Q2'2026, average property prices for Modi Rashmi Heights moved from ₹ 22,450/sqft to ₹ 32,000/sqft, reflecting a 42.54% rise.\n\n#### MMRDA Presents Surplus Budget with Significant Allocation for Infrastructure\n\nMMRDA has presented a surplus budget of ₹48,072 crore, with 87% allocated to infrastructure projects, including roads, public transport, and urban development. A notable provision of ₹4,000 crore is earmarked for the development of Mumbai 3.0 New Town, aiming for planned urban expansion.\n\n#### BMC Budget Includes ₹6,475 Crore for Water Security Projects\n\nThe BMC's FY26-27 budget includes a substantial allocation of ₹6,475 crore for water security initiatives. This funding is designated for projects such as the Manori desalination plant (₹500 crore) and the Gargai project (₹437.51 crore), aimed at augmenting the city's water supply capacity.\n\n#### Mumbai-Pune Expressway 'Missing Link' Project Set for May 1 Inauguration, Promising Safer and Faster Travel\n\nThe highly anticipated 'Missing Link' project on the Mumbai-Pune Expressway is set to be inaugurated on May 1, significantly reducing travel time by approximately 30 minutes and enhancing safety. The 10.5-km stretch features tunnels and a bridge, bypassing the accident-prone Khandala Ghat. This infrastructure upgrade is expected to ease traffic congestion, improve travel safety.\n\nDuring Q1'2026, average property prices for Modi Rashmi Heights moved from ₹ 21,600/sqft to ₹ 22,450/sqft, reflecting a 3.94% rise.\n\nDuring Q4'2025, average property prices for Modi Rashmi Heights moved from ₹ 21,550/sqft to ₹ 21,600/sqft, reflecting a 0.23% rise.\n\nA total of 80 out of 91 launched units have been booked as of December 2025.\n\nStructural Works reach 100% completion, External Works has reached 100%, Internal finishing stands at 100%, MEP Services including lift and staircases, are now 100% done.\n\n## Modi Rashmi Heights Floor Plans\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 514 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Modi Rashmi Heights, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/modi-rashmi-heights-apartment-2-bhk-514sqft-20252413122400.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 1.64 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 2 BHK 700 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Modi Rashmi Heights, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/modi-rashmi-heights-apartment-2-bhk-700sqft-20252413122409.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.24 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 737 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Modi Rashmi Heights, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/modi-rashmi-heights-apartment-3-bhk-737sqft-20252413122417.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.36 Cr\n\n![Floor plan of 3 BHK 930 Sq. Ft. Apartment in Modi Rashmi Heights, Mumbai](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/unit-image/modi-rashmi-heights-apartment-3-bhk-930sqft-20252413122425.jpg?aio=w-392;h-392;crop;)\n\nPrice:₹ 2.97 Cr\n\n## Rental Listings in Modi Rashmi Heights\n\nExplore rental listings currently available in Modi Rashmi Heights, Mumbai.\n\n![2 BHK Apartment For Rent in Modi Rashmi Heights in Kandivali West, Mumbai]()\n\nKandivali West, Mumbai\n\n![Sunil Ransure  profile picture]()\n![Sunil Ransure]()\n\nClassic Property\n\n## Master Plan, Photos, Videos & Brochure of Modi Rashmi Heights\n\nExplore the master plan, project photos and walkthrough videos of Modi Rashmi Heights to understand the overall layout, tower placement, amenities, landscaped spaces and key highlights before making your buying decision.\n\n![Modi Rashmi Heights Tower View](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/proje