tic.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-rustomjee-adarsh-heritage-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Kalpataru Avenue residential project in Kandivali East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kalpataru-avenue-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nKandivali East, Mumbai\n\nOffice Space\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Kalpataru Yugdharma residential project in Malad West](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/project-image/kalpataru-yugdharma-project-project-large-image1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nMalad West, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n![Kalpataru Vatika residential project in Kandivali East](https://static.squareyards.com/resources/images/mumbai/tn-projectflagship/tn-kalpataru-vatika-project-flagship1.jpg?aio=w-230;h-145;crop;)\n\nKandivali East, Mumbai\n\n2 BHK Apartment\n\nPrice On Request\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions About Modi Rashmi Heights\n\n### What is the price range of flats in Modi Rashmi Heights?\n\nApartment prices at Modi Rashmi Heights start from ₹ 1.64 Cr and go up to ₹ 2.97 Cr, with an average price of ₹ 32,000 Per Sq. Ft. per sq ft.\n\n### When was Modi Rashmi Heights completed and is it ready for possession?\n\nModi Rashmi Heights has received its completion and occupancy approvals. With a possession status of Ready to Move, buyers can move in immediately after completing purchase formalities.\n\n### Where is Modi Rashmi Heights located?\n\nModi Rashmi Heights is located in Kandivali West, Mumbai, with the complete address being Kandivali West Mumbai, 400067.\n\n### Is Modi Rashmi Heights more expensive than under-construction projects nearby?\n\nReady to Move projects like Modi Rashmi Heights may be priced slightly higher, but they eliminate construction delays, GST, and rental overlap costs.\n\n### What are the popular amenities available at Modi Rashmi Heights?\n\nResidents of Modi Rashmi Heights can enjoy amenities such as Kids' Play Areas / Sand Pits, Jogging / Cycle Track, Power Backup, Treated Water Supply, 24 x 7 Security, CCTV / Video Surveillance, Normal Park / Central Green, Indoor Games, designed for comfort and a modern lifestyle.\n\nThis website is only for the purpose of providing information regarding real estate projects in different geographies. Any information which is being provided on this website is not an advertisement or a solicitation. The company has not verified the information and the compliances of the projects. Further, the company has not checked the RERA\\* registration status of the real estate projects listed herein. The company does not make any representation in regards to the compliances done against these projects. Please note that you should make yourself aware about the RERA\\* registration status of the listed real estate projects.\n\n**\\*Real Estate (Regulation & Development) Act, 2016.**\n\n![Bangalore city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/bangalore.svg)\n![Chennai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/chennai.svg)\n![Delhi city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/delhi.svg)\n![Gurgaon city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/gurgaon.svg)\n![Hyderabad city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/hyderabad.svg)\n![Kolkata city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/kolkata.svg)\n![Lucknow city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/lucknow.svg)\n![Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/mumbai.svg)\n![Navi Mumbai city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/navi-mumbai.svg)\n![Noida city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/noida.svg)\n![Pune city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/pune.svg)\n![Thane city icon](/assets/images/city-svg-icons/thane.svg)\n\nSquare Yards is India's largest Integrated real estate platform, with category leadership presence across multiple touchpoints of consumer home ownership journey. With Urbanisation and rising disposable incomes as the core theme, Square Yards, with 8mn+ monthly traffic and ~USD 7bn+ GTV, is the largest and asset light proxy play to the growing residential demand story of India. One of the few Indian start ups to taste global success with presence in 100+ cities across 9 countries, Square Yards is at the forefront of tech adoption in the sector, with multiple patents across VR/AI domains.\n\n![SQUAREYARDS ANDROID APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/google-play.png)\n![SQUAREYARDS IOS APP](https://static.squareyards.com/ui-assets/images/app-store.png)\n![loader](/assets/images/loader3-big.gif)","images":[]},{"url":"https://rashmisignature.com","title":"RASHMI SIGNATURE MALAD at Malad West by MODI NAVNIRMAN ...","raw_content":"[×](javascript:void(0))\n\n[Call Us](#call_me) [Contact Us](#top_contact_form) [About](#intro) [Special Offers](#special_offers) [Highlights](#highlights) [Gallery](#image_gallery) [Configurations](#property_configurations) [Office Address](#sales_office) [Maharera](#footer)\n\n☰\n\n# [RASHMI SIGNATURE MALAD MODI NAVNIRMAN](#)\n\n[![RASHMI SIGNATURE MALAD Featured Slide](https://micl.site/uploads/images/properties/288/WhatsApp Image 2026-03-26 at 10.51.13.jpeg)](#)\n\n[![RASHMI SIGNATURE MALAD Slide 1](https://micl.site/uploads/images/properties/288/Artboard 9 copy 4.png)](#)\n\n[![RASHMI SIGNATURE MALAD Slide 2](https://micl.site/uploads/images/properties/288/Artboard 9 copy (1).png)](#)\n\n[![RASHMI SIGNATURE MALAD Slide 3](https://micl.site/uploads/images/properties/288/Artboard 9 copy 2 (1).png)](#)\n\n[![RASHMI SIGNATURE MALAD Slide 4](https://micl.site/uploads/images/properties/288/WhatsApp Image 2026-03-31 at 12.35.20.jpeg)](#)\n\n[![Excel Bellissima Banner](https://micl.site/frontend/images/down-arrow-circle.png)](#intro)\n\n* Call Us:\n* [+918451919177](tel:+918451919177)\n* [Contact Us](#bottom_contact_form)\n\nCall **RASHMI SIGNATURE MALAD** [+918451919177](tel:+918451919177) For Sample Flat Video, Photos, Price, Project Brochure, Reviews, Floor Plans. Find Site Location, Site Address, Sales Office Address & RERA Details Of **RASHMI SIGNATURE MALAD** at Malad West, .   \n **RASHMI SIGNATURE MALAD Experience Centre.**   \n **RASHMI SIGNATURE MALAD** RERA registration number: P51800077248\n\n## About RASHMI SIGNATURE MALAD\n\n### MODI NAVNIRMAN\n\n### At Malad West by MODI NAVNIRMAN\n\nRashmi Signature by Modi's Navnirman is a contemporary residential project located in Malad West, Mumbai, spanning 270,000 square feet. The development consists of three towers, each comprising 18 floors of thoughtfully planned 2 BHK and 3 BHK apartments. Designed to offer smart layouts that maximize space and natural light, the project ensures a comfortable living experience. Additionally, its strategic location guarantees seamless connectivity to major commercial centers and lifestyle hubs, making it an excellent choice for families looking for convenience and modern living in the city.\n\n[Price On Request](https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=918451919177&text=Interested in Price of RASHMI SIGNATURE MALAD)\n\n### Make an Appointment\n\nPlease enter the details below to get in touch with us!\n\n![RASHMI SIGNATURE MALAD Gallery Photo 2](https://micl.site/uploads/images/properties/288/Sundar Nagar_Cam01_03.jpg)\n\n### RASHMI SIGNATURE MALAD Overview\n\n#### Premium 2 & 3 BHK Homes\n\nA rare gated address that brings together green serenity + city connectivity + modern lifestyle ✨🏙️🌳 (Yes — with trending amenities like a Pickleball Court 🏓) Kids Play Area, Jogging Track, Indoor Gym, Yoga Area, Reflexology Path, Outdoor Gym, Multipurpose Court, Outdoor Seating, Badminton Court, Lawn Area, Gazebo Seating, Hammock Garden\n\n🏗️ Project Snapshot ✅ Construction Status: ~70% Completed 🗓️ Targeted Possession: December 2026 🎯 📌 RERA Possession: August 2027 🏷️ 🚗 Parking: Ramp + Surface\n\nproperty\\_sp\\_offers\\_overview\n\n[Download Floor Plan](https://api.whatsapp.com/send?phone=918451919177&text=Interested in Floor Plan of RAS